      {
        "number": 10,
        "internalPageId": 10,
        "title": "Language Targets",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Language Targets",
          "Functions Examples 1 Ongoing actions. He is taking a shower now. / We are having English class at the moment. 2 Actions happening for a certain time period. We are rehearsing for the recital these days. / For now, I am doing work from home. 3 Actions happening once and again. Jake is always eating burgers. / They are always playing soccer.",
          "When we use the present progressive we can take into account some functions.",
          "TO CONSIDER Time phrases may vary a little depending on the function we want to express. There is a fourth function related to expressing future."
        ],
        "links": [],
        "media": [
